          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yoshua aliiteka nchi yote; aliwashinda wafalme wa sehemu za milimani, eneo la Negebu, na sehemu za nchi tambarare na miteremko. Hakuacha chochote chenye uhai ila aliangamiza kila kitu kama Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli, alivyoamuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua aliwashinda watu wote kutoka Kadesh-barnea mpaka Gaza, na kutoka Gosheni mpaka Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliweza kuitwaa nchi hii yote kwa sababu Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli, aliwapigania Waisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yoshua akarudi mpaka kambini huko Gilgali pamoja na Waisraeli wote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
